EXPECT_HAS | game/variables.txt | \nphase=1\n | unowned-property-waits-for-Buy-or-Pass
EXPECT_HAS | game/switches.txt | awaiting_buy=1\n | switch-awaiting_buy=1
EXPECT_HAS | game/dice_ledger.txt | DICE\p42\p0\p4\p3\n | the-roll-is-in-the-dice-ledger
EXPECT_LACKS | game/cash_ledger.txt | \pgo\n | no-GO-payout-without-passing-GO
